---
// The two buttons of a scene that loops: Pause (Play when paused) and, with reduced motion or after a
// pause, Step 1 s. `clock()` in scene.ts wires them. Put this at the end of the `controls` slot.
---

<button type="button" class="pbtn" data-act="pause">Pause</button>
<button type="button" class="pbtn" data-act="step" hidden>Step 1 s</button>
